# GA4 measurement id for the production web build (same web stream as the
# narenana.com homepage — events are split by page path / event params).
# Committed on purpose: measurement ids are public in every page's source
# anyway. Without this, utils/analytics.js no-ops and every track() call is
# lost — which is exactly what happened from launch until 2026-09-27.
VITE_GA_ID=G-1KY518LPBH

# Sentry DSN for the production web build (project "rc-log-viewer" in the
# narenanacom org). A DSN is a public ingest key — it ships in every page's
# client JS by design, so committing it here (like the GA id above) is safe.
# Without it, utils/sentry.js no-ops and no errors are reported. The SDK runs
# always-anonymous: IP + URL query scrubbed, no PII, no log bytes. VITE_RELEASE
# is injected at build time (git short SHA) for per-version error grouping.
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://1f51317b6efd4dc35451631e37b979dd@o4511331888005120.ingest.us.sentry.io/4511332010229760
